"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years, the most of any pair. In 2025, April to May ran 148% of normal on the middle, while October to November fell to 45%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 37% of normal on the middle. Grid 22114 had its driest year in 2007 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
